(To achieve frictionless, fire-and-forget reliability, the terminal integrates two) Tj
T* (automated background daemons:) Tj
T* (• Watchdog Reconciliation Loop: Runs asynchronously in the background. It) Tj
T* (continuously monitors the on-chain consensus state against the local database. If) Tj
T* (any database balance drift or entry mismatch is detected, it automatically triggers a) Tj
T* (Global Re-index, healing the drift instantly.) Tj
T* (• Intelligent Rail Selection \(Dynamic Failover\): If the primary Coinbase API) Tj
T* (experiences connection drops or latency spikes, the routing engine automatically) Tj
T* (redirects execution to the secondary Kraken OTC rail.) Tj
